  "_comment": "The default look. Other themes list only what they change; any key they leave out is read from here. Painters: flat (FlatLaf chips), edge (flat chips with a coloured left edge, a lip on the main button), forged (gradient metal and stone, animated), ribbon (the game's Wiki banner, the Wiki's default), crystal (facets and a glint), wood (grain and brass studs), molten (obsidian cracks, rising embers; lava on the main button), arcane (stars, a pulsing outline and an orbiting spark). Frames: flat (square outline), chamfer (cut corners, dark rim) or plank (wood grain). New painters read <painter>Top/Bottom/Text for ordinary buttons and <painter>MainTop/MainBottom/MainText for the main one, plus <painter>Rim and <painter>HoverRim. corner (0-6 px), motion and texture (on/off) apply to every painter. panel, text, muted, well, wellOutline and focus colour the panel and its inputs; dpsEdge, specEdge, costEdge, styleEdge, tabSelected and owned colour the results. primaryFont and buttonFont: default, small, regular or bold. ghostHover, rowHover, badge*, scroll*, progress, boss and warning colour the smaller parts.",
